{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BTSr6dVg7rsVamf6VfEYyw","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→sequenceDiagram\n     2→    participant Browser as Browser<br/>(Vista Frontend)\n     3→    participant Vista as Vista FastAPI<br/>(Hub Server)\n     4→    participant Companion as Companion<br/>(Bun/Hono)\n     5→    participant Claude as Claude CLI<br/>(--sdk-url)\n     6→    participant FS as File System<br/>(arch/ + specs/)\n     7→\n     8→    Note over Browser,Claude: Session Creation\n     9→    Browser->>Vista: POST /api/chat/sessions<br/>{provider: \"claude\", model: \"opus\", feature: \"...\"}\n    10→    Vista->>Vista: Create ChatSession<br/>Save to disk\n    11→    Vista->>Companion: Create CLI session<br/>(spawn claude --sdk-url ws://companion/ws/cli/{id})\n    12→    Companion->>Claude: Launch process with --sdk-url\n    13→    Claude-->>Companion: WebSocket connected (NDJSON)\n    14→    Vista-->>Browser: {session_id, status: \"ready\"}\n    15→\n    16→    Note over Browser,Claude: Send Message with Context\n    17→    Browser->>Vista: POST /api/chat/sessions/{id}/messages<br/>{message, attached_diagrams, selected_elements}\n    18→    Vista->>Vista: ContextAssembler:<br/>system prompt + diagram contents<br/>+ selected nodes + history\n    19→    Vista->>Companion: WebSocket: {type: \"user\", message: {role: \"user\", content: [{type: \"text\", text: assembled_prompt}]}}\n    20→    Companion->>Claude: NDJSON relay to CLI stdin\n    21→\n    22→    Note over Browser,Claude: Streaming Response\n    23→    Browser->>Vista: GET /api/chat/sessions/{id}/stream (SSE)\n    24→\n    25→    Claude->>Companion: NDJSON: {type: \"stream_event\", event: {type: \"content_block_delta\", delta: {text: \"token\"}}}\n    26→    Companion->>Vista: WebSocket relay\n    27→    Vista->>Browser: SSE: event: token, data: {\"text\": \"token\"}\n    28→\n    29→    Claude->>Companion: NDJSON: {type: \"stream_event\", ...more tokens...}\n    30→    Companion->>Vista: WebSocket relay\n    31→    Vista->>Browser: SSE: event: token, data: {\"text\": \"...\"}\n    32→\n    33→    Note over Browser,FS: AI Edits Diagram (auto-approved)\n    34→    Claude->>FS: Write to arch/system-architecture.mmd\n    35→    Note over Vista,FS: watchdog detects file change\n    36→    FS-->>Vista: FileModifiedEvent\n    37→    Vista->>Vista: ManifestUpdater:<br/>check if new/deleted file\n    38→    Vista->>Browser: SSE: event: diagram_changed,<br/>data: {file, content}\n    39→    Browser->>Browser: Re-render Mermaid diagram\n    40→\n    41→    Claude->>Companion: NDJSON: {type: \"result\", ...}\n    42→    Companion->>Vista: WebSocket relay\n    43→    Vista->>Vista: SessionService.add_message()<br/>Save assistant response\n    44→    Vista->>Browser: SSE: event: message_done,<br/>data: {role: \"assistant\", content: \"...\"}\n    45→"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"615fcba1-13a5-40a3-839d-703775331047","uuid":"db46ae82-5f05-4cbb-97be-a684d9597dad","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:/Users/Grove/OneDrive/Documents/PYTHON/claude_plugins/vista/.vista/features/architecture-chat/arch/sequence-claude-chat.mmd","content":"sequenceDiagram\n    participant Browser as Browser<br/>(Vista Frontend)\n    participant Vista as Vista FastAPI<br/>(Hub Server)\n    participant Companion as Companion<br/>(Bun/Hono)\n    participant Claude as Claude CLI<br/>(--sdk-url)\n    participant FS as File System<br/>(arch/ + specs/)\n\n    Note over Browser,Claude: Session Creation\n    Browser->>Vista: POST /api/chat/sessions<br/>{provider: \"claude\", model: \"opus\", feature: \"...\"}\n    Vista->>Vista: Create ChatSession<br/>Save to disk\n    Vista->>Companion: Create CLI session<br/>(spawn claude --sdk-url ws://companion/ws/cli/{id})\n    Companion->>Claude: Launch process with --sdk-url\n    Claude-->>Companion: WebSocket connected (NDJSON)\n    Vista-->>Browser: {session_id, status: \"ready\"}\n\n    Note over Browser,Claude: Send Message with Context\n    Browser->>Vista: POST /api/chat/sessions/{id}/messages<br/>{message, attached_diagrams, selected_elements}\n    Vista->>Vista: ContextAssembler:<br/>system prompt + diagram contents<br/>+ selected nodes + history\n    Vista->>Companion: WebSocket: {type: \"user\", message: {role: \"user\", content: [{type: \"text\", text: assembled_prompt}]}}\n    Companion->>Claude: NDJSON relay to CLI stdin\n\n    Note over Browser,Claude: Streaming Response\n    Browser->>Vista: GET /api/chat/sessions/{id}/stream (SSE)\n\n    Claude->>Companion: NDJSON: {type: \"stream_event\", event: {type: \"content_block_delta\", delta: {text: \"token\"}}}\n    Companion->>Vista: WebSocket relay\n    Vista->>Browser: SSE: event: token, data: {\"text\": \"token\"}\n\n    Claude->>Companion: NDJSON: {type: \"stream_event\", ...more tokens...}\n    Companion->>Vista: WebSocket relay\n    Vista->>Browser: SSE: event: token, data: {\"text\": \"...\"}\n\n    Note over Browser,FS: AI Edits Diagram (auto-approved)\n    Claude->>FS: Write to arch/system-architecture.mmd\n    Note over Vista,FS: watchdog detects file change\n    FS-->>Vista: FileModifiedEvent\n    Vista->>Vista: ManifestUpdater:<br/>check if new/deleted file\n    Vista->>Browser: SSE: event: diagram_changed,<br/>data: {file, content}\n    Browser->>Browser: Re-render Mermaid diagram\n\n    Claude->>Companion: NDJSON: {type: \"result\", ...}\n    Companion->>Vista: WebSocket relay\n    Vista->>Vista: SessionService.add_message()<br/>Save assistant response\n    Vista->>Browser: SSE: event: message_done,<br/>data: {role: \"assistant\", content: \"...\"}\n","numLines":45,"startLine":1,"totalLines":45}}}
