{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BWqUNr2ekRC7j8XXVZad25","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→sequenceDiagram\n     2→    participant Browser as Browser<br/>(Vista Frontend)\n     3→    participant Vista as Vista FastAPI<br/>(Hub Server)\n     4→    participant OC as OpenCode Server<br/>(opencode serve)\n     5→    participant FS as File System<br/>(arch/ + specs/)\n     6→\n     7→    Note over Browser,OC: Session Creation\n     8→    Browser->>Vista: POST /api/chat/sessions<br/>{provider: \"opencode\", model: \"claude-3-5-sonnet\", feature: \"...\"}\n     9→    Vista->>Vista: Create ChatSession<br/>Save to disk\n    10→    Vista->>OC: POST /session<br/>{title: \"arch-chat-{feature}\", permission: [...]}\n    11→    OC-->>Vista: {id: \"oc-session-id\"}\n    12→    Vista->>Vista: Map vista_session_id → oc_session_id\n    13→    Vista-->>Browser: {session_id, status: \"ready\"}\n    14→\n    15→    Note over Browser,OC: Subscribe to Events\n    16→    Vista->>OC: GET /event (SSE subscribe)\n    17→    Note over Vista,OC: Persistent SSE connection<br/>for real-time events\n    18→\n    19→    Note over Browser,OC: Send Message with Context\n    20→    Browser->>Vista: POST /api/chat/sessions/{id}/messages<br/>{message, attached_diagrams, selected_elements}\n    21→    Vista->>Vista: ContextAssembler:<br/>system prompt + diagram contents<br/>+ selected nodes + history\n    22→    Vista->>OC: POST /session/{oc_id}/message<br/>{parts: [{type: \"text\", text: assembled_prompt}],<br/>model: {providerID: \"anthropic\", modelID: \"...\"}}\n    23→\n    24→    Note over Browser,OC: Streaming Response\n    25→    Browser->>Vista: GET /api/chat/sessions/{id}/stream (SSE)\n    26→\n    27→    OC-->>Vista: SSE: event: message.part.updated<br/>{properties: {text: \"token...\"}}\n    28→    Vista->>Browser: SSE: event: token, data: {\"text\": \"token...\"}\n    29→\n    30→    OC-->>Vista: SSE: event: message.part.updated<br/>{properties: {text: \"more tokens...\"}}\n    31→    Vista->>Browser: SSE: event: token, data: {\"text\": \"more tokens...\"}\n    32→\n    33→    Note over Browser,FS: AI Edits Diagram\n    34→    OC->>FS: Write to arch/data-model.mmd\n    35→    Note over Vista,FS: watchdog detects file change\n    36→    FS-->>Vista: FileModifiedEvent\n    37→    Vista->>Vista: ManifestUpdater:<br/>check if new/deleted file\n    38→    Vista->>Browser: SSE: event: diagram_changed,<br/>data: {file, content}\n    39→    Browser->>Browser: Re-render Mermaid diagram\n    40→\n    41→    OC-->>Vista: SSE: event: session.idle\n    42→    Vista->>Vista: SessionService.add_message()<br/>Save assistant response\n    43→    Vista->>Browser: SSE: event: message_done,<br/>data: {role: \"assistant\", content: \"...\"}\n    44→"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"615fcba1-13a5-40a3-839d-703775331047","uuid":"442935af-be9d-4ce0-aa2a-72de6d23319e","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:/Users/Grove/OneDrive/Documents/PYTHON/claude_plugins/vista/.vista/features/architecture-chat/arch/sequence-opencode-chat.mmd","content":"sequenceDiagram\n    participant Browser as Browser<br/>(Vista Frontend)\n    participant Vista as Vista FastAPI<br/>(Hub Server)\n    participant OC as OpenCode Server<br/>(opencode serve)\n    participant FS as File System<br/>(arch/ + specs/)\n\n    Note over Browser,OC: Session Creation\n    Browser->>Vista: POST /api/chat/sessions<br/>{provider: \"opencode\", model: \"claude-3-5-sonnet\", feature: \"...\"}\n    Vista->>Vista: Create ChatSession<br/>Save to disk\n    Vista->>OC: POST /session<br/>{title: \"arch-chat-{feature}\", permission: [...]}\n    OC-->>Vista: {id: \"oc-session-id\"}\n    Vista->>Vista: Map vista_session_id → oc_session_id\n    Vista-->>Browser: {session_id, status: \"ready\"}\n\n    Note over Browser,OC: Subscribe to Events\n    Vista->>OC: GET /event (SSE subscribe)\n    Note over Vista,OC: Persistent SSE connection<br/>for real-time events\n\n    Note over Browser,OC: Send Message with Context\n    Browser->>Vista: POST /api/chat/sessions/{id}/messages<br/>{message, attached_diagrams, selected_elements}\n    Vista->>Vista: ContextAssembler:<br/>system prompt + diagram contents<br/>+ selected nodes + history\n    Vista->>OC: POST /session/{oc_id}/message<br/>{parts: [{type: \"text\", text: assembled_prompt}],<br/>model: {providerID: \"anthropic\", modelID: \"...\"}}\n\n    Note over Browser,OC: Streaming Response\n    Browser->>Vista: GET /api/chat/sessions/{id}/stream (SSE)\n\n    OC-->>Vista: SSE: event: message.part.updated<br/>{properties: {text: \"token...\"}}\n    Vista->>Browser: SSE: event: token, data: {\"text\": \"token...\"}\n\n    OC-->>Vista: SSE: event: message.part.updated<br/>{properties: {text: \"more tokens...\"}}\n    Vista->>Browser: SSE: event: token, data: {\"text\": \"more tokens...\"}\n\n    Note over Browser,FS: AI Edits Diagram\n    OC->>FS: Write to arch/data-model.mmd\n    Note over Vista,FS: watchdog detects file change\n    FS-->>Vista: FileModifiedEvent\n    Vista->>Vista: ManifestUpdater:<br/>check if new/deleted file\n    Vista->>Browser: SSE: event: diagram_changed,<br/>data: {file, content}\n    Browser->>Browser: Re-render Mermaid diagram\n\n    OC-->>Vista: SSE: event: session.idle\n    Vista->>Vista: SessionService.add_message()<br/>Save assistant response\n    Vista->>Browser: SSE: event: message_done,<br/>data: {role: \"assistant\", content: \"...\"}\n","numLines":44,"startLine":1,"totalLines":44}}}
